  "sayCount": 14871,
  "saySample": [
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You push through the doors into open air. Haven grounds — tents, a fire pit, worn paths. The world is that way."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You break ground behind the hall — bed 1 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "You break ground behind the hall — bed 2 of 2, turned and ready. Sow seed to start a crop."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with thick glasses returns with water: +3 clean."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a wiry build returns with water: +2 clean."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "💧 A woman, maybe 40s, with a crooked nose returns with water: +2 clean."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "\"Hey.\" A woman, maybe 30s, with thick glasses settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A woman, maybe 30s, with thick glasses.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "⚠ STARVING: health and energy falling. You went to bed on an empty stomach."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "A person, maybe 40s, with freckles came back with 649 kcal of something edible. The pantry breathes."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Ethan and Divya lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Sanne and Aroha lingered over the fire together."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "📓 Journal: the woman in her 40s, with restless hands taught the woman in her 40s, with a crooked nose Steady Hands."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "🤒 Gustavo is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse. A person, maybe 40s, with freckles is already boiling water. It's handled."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "Aria sits with Gustavo — cool cloth, bitter tea, watching the breathing."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "🔧 Technique learned: tick removal."
   },
   {
    "day": 1,
    "text": "A person, maybe 40s, with freckles watches you scratch at your ankle and shakes their head. “Here — tweezers at the head, steady pull, don’t twist. Like this.” (You learned tick removal.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Enrique Alvarado reads the sky: clear tomorrow, cold."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands will work the garden once each day while at Haven. Other orders take priority."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You step into the Haven hall."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📋 A person, maybe 20s — 🎣 Fish. They'll report back by next part."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands doesn't say a word. They just stand there, arms crossed, until you finish giving the order. The silence does the talking."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "(Talking costs a little energy — 10 kcal a conversation. Small talk is cheap; going deep costs time, not more food.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Hunger gnaws. The pack is thin — work the green, haul it back, get it named at camp. That's the whole game."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Aroha,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Aroha.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Aroha)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "...and then it lands: A person, maybe 30s speaks 🇺🇸 English. A few shared words. Gestures. Patience."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"Enrique,\" they say, touching their chest. \"I'm Enrique.\" You'll remember that."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "📓 Journal: learned their name (Enrique)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You eat Dried meat and Trail mix (1400 kcal)."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "It's barely dawn. The day is yours — sleep is for later."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "No risky water to boil."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Drank clean water."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s, with freckles says. (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🌿 A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands checks the pantry before heading out — the shelves are full, ~6 days of fresh on hand… leaves the fish nets standing and turns to the wood run instead. The pantry can't take more; the wild will keep."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🪵 A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands hauls back 4 wood. The pile grows. (14 logs now.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "💧 A person, maybe 20s returns with 10L of creek water. Risky until the hearth boils it."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A person, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Enrique heads out for water. \"Fetching water. Somebody has to.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Aroha heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A woman, maybe 40s, with a crooked nose heads out for water. \"The well won't fill itself.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "Iron cold. Even the ticks are shelved."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "— MIDDAY — Honest work hours. Heat builds."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "A person, maybe 20s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
   },
   {
    "day": 2,
    "text": "🪨 A woman, maybe 40s, with restless hands pries 1 stone loose from the creek bed. The building pile grows. (1 stone now.)"
   }
